<title>BRAZIL: FOCUS-Brazil admits CVRD sale could be delayed.</title>
<headline>FOCUS-Brazil admits CVRD sale could be delayed.</headline>
<byline>Simona de Logu</byline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's government has admitted the privatization of mining giant CVRD might suffer a slight delay given the sheer number of legal challenges stacked up against it.</p>
<p>More than 60 lawsuits have been filed in courts all across Brazil threatening to delay Latin America's largest privatization to date at any moment.</p>
<p>However, the government is hopeful and determined to see that the privatization process will begin as scheduled April 29 with the auction of a 40-45-percent voting stake in CVRD.</p>
</text>
